                            "steamid": "76561198046151821",
                            "num_reviews": 12,
                            "playtime_forever": 73,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 73,
                            "last_played": 1519892944
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "While this game is an interesting concept, it isn't very well executed. The controls are a bit clunky, combat feels stiff and unresponsive and the AI leaves a lot to be desired. This feels a lot like an early access title. There isn't a whole lot of content to speak of. It calls itself \"randomly generated\" but it's just a collection of a few dozen pre-made rooms cobbled together. The subtitles don't actually work, and the speech isn't in English, for the most part. The only redeeming quality is the graphics, which aren't bad. \n\nAll in all, I'd give this game a 4/10.",
